    "description": "The configured Cluster has three fields. Two array elements fill its first fields and the missing final field receives its intrinsic I32 default; excess array elements would be ignored.\n\nThe configured Cluster has three fields. Two array elements fill its first fields and the missing final field receives its intrinsic I32 default; excess array elements would be ignored.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.array.owned@1.\nExpected:\nresult (cluster<\"element1\":i32,\"element2\":i32,\"element3\":i32>) = {\"element1\":7,\"element2\":8,\"element3\":0}\n",
